%F A135869 a(0) = 1; a(n) = 3^(n-1) * Sum_{k=0..n-1} a(k) * a(n-1-k). - _Seiichi Manyama_, Sep 26 2026
%o A135869 (PARI) {a(n) = my(A=1+x+x*O(x^n)); for(i=0,n,A=1+x*subst(A,x,3*x)^2); polcoeff(A,n)}
